{"2808350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Idosra: The Electric Renaissance", "steam_appid": 2808350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An Action-Adventure Roleplaying Game Set in North Carolina's Distant Future</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump, climb, explore, and battle through over 70 areas packed with action, adventure, and intrigue!<i> Idosra: The Electric Renaissance</i> is a hybrid platformer/roleplaying game set in a future world on the verge of rediscovering electricity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808350/extras/83ed2849e072e3cdeaa8af9b48abe6ab.poster.avif?t=1762306674\" width=616 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808350/extras/83ed2849e072e3cdeaa8af9b48abe6ab.webm?t=1762306674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808350/extras/83ed2849e072e3cdeaa8af9b48abe6ab.mp4?t=1762306674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's election year in the Vallas Empire, and Marika finds herself in the crossfire between two opposing bodies. On one side is a government that is taking advantage of a recently rediscovered force of nature: electricity. On the other side is a faction that wants to seize control of this knowledge for itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808350/extras/349d4ccf0f93ea604fd314dbb42098aa.poster.avif?t=1762306674\" width=640 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808350/extras/349d4ccf0f93ea604fd314dbb42098aa.webm?t=1762306674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808350/extras/349d4ccf0f93ea604fd314dbb42098aa.mp4?t=1762306674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sea levels are falling and revealing ancient coastal cities. Rumor has it that these cities hold lost secrets to the generation of electricity. Electricity could be a great boon to the Vallan cities that rely solely on coal and gas. The lost &quot;fire&quot; can bring wealth and prosperity. It can also grant unimaginable power. The empire has shown an interest in researching and harnessing electricity, and the Vallan scholars are hard at work studying the ruins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808350/extras/274793098222704a8f7855b81f1803f7.poster.avif?t=1762306674\" width=640 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808350/extras/274793098222704a8f7855b81f1803f7.webm?t=1762306674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808350/extras/274793098222704a8f7855b81f1803f7.mp4?t=1762306674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marika has been tagged as an &quot;enemy of the state&quot;.  Does the empire suspect she has a power that even she herself isn't aware of? Or, is this a terrible mistake-the fault of the recently installed &quot;eyes&quot; and other newfound devices the empire has unearthed, but does not understand?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808350/extras/ee37448feab02a3a03f953d7d1b6f054.poster.avif?t=1762306674\" width=640 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808350/extras/ee37448feab02a3a03f953d7d1b6f054.webm?t=1762306674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808350/extras/ee37448feab02a3a03f953d7d1b6f054.mp4?t=1762306674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The answer lies in the ruins of an ancient city, known as &quot;Idosra&quot;. If only Marika can find it before her aggressors. Step carefully! Marika's success lies is in her ability to learn how the new technology works-and the role it plays in the Vallas Empire's plans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808350/extras/c7a5c570a9fd9f71ed158f4d81a2f2fa.poster.avif?t=1762306674\" width=640 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808350/extras/c7a5c570a9fd9f71ed158f4d81a2f2fa.webm?t=1762306674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808350/extras/c7a5c570a9fd9f71ed158f4d81a2f2fa.mp4?t=1762306674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 70 areas to explore! Adventure through a world full of secret rooms and branching paths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn dozens of skills featuring multiple mastery tiers. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A character leveling system that rewards both exploration and prowess in combat. Earn experience points and spend them to read from over 100 skill books.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find new equipment, weapons, trinkets, and other goodies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet and converse with a wide cast of characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect achievements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idosra is highly moddable. You can edit the levels, maps, and dialog scripts using external tools. The modding system makes it easy to play a modified game and also preserve the original game data.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An Action-Adventure Roleplaying Game Set in North Carolina's Distant Future</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump, climb, explore, and battle through over 70 areas packed with action, adventure, and intrigue!<i> Idosra: The Electric Renaissance</i> is a hybrid platformer/roleplaying game set in a future world on the verge of rediscovering electricity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808350/extras/83ed2849e072e3cdeaa8af9b48abe6ab.poster.avif?t=1762306674\" width=616 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808350/extras/83ed2849e072e3cdeaa8af9b48abe6ab.webm?t=1762306674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808350/extras/83ed2849e072e3cdeaa8af9b48abe6ab.mp4?t=1762306674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's election year in the Vallas Empire, and Marika finds herself in the crossfire between two opposing bodies. On one side is a government that is taking advantage of a recently rediscovered force of nature: electricity. On the other side is a faction that wants to seize control of this knowledge for itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808350/extras/349d4ccf0f93ea604fd314dbb42098aa.poster.avif?t=1762306674\" width=640 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808350/extras/349d4ccf0f93ea604fd314dbb42098aa.webm?t=1762306674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808350/extras/349d4ccf0f93ea604fd314dbb42098aa.mp4?t=1762306674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sea levels are falling and revealing ancient coastal cities. Rumor has it that these cities hold lost secrets to the generation of electricity. Electricity could be a great boon to the Vallan cities that rely solely on coal and gas. The lost &quot;fire&quot; can bring wealth and prosperity. It can also grant unimaginable power. The empire has shown an interest in researching and harnessing electricity, and the Vallan scholars are hard at work studying the ruins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808350/extras/274793098222704a8f7855b81f1803f7.poster.avif?t=1762306674\" width=640 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808350/extras/274793098222704a8f7855b81f1803f7.webm?t=1762306674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808350/extras/274793098222704a8f7855b81f1803f7.mp4?t=1762306674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marika has been tagged as an &quot;enemy of the state&quot;.  Does the empire suspect she has a power that even she herself isn't aware of? Or, is this a terrible mistake-the fault of the recently installed &quot;eyes&quot; and other newfound devices the empire has unearthed, but does not understand?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808350/extras/ee37448feab02a3a03f953d7d1b6f054.poster.avif?t=1762306674\" width=640 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808350/extras/ee37448feab02a3a03f953d7d1b6f054.webm?t=1762306674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808350/extras/ee37448feab02a3a03f953d7d1b6f054.mp4?t=1762306674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The answer lies in the ruins of an ancient city, known as &quot;Idosra&quot;. If only Marika can find it before her aggressors. Step carefully! Marika's success lies is in her ability to learn how the new technology works-and the role it plays in the Vallas Empire's plans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808350/extras/c7a5c570a9fd9f71ed158f4d81a2f2fa.poster.avif?t=1762306674\" width=640 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808350/extras/c7a5c570a9fd9f71ed158f4d81a2f2fa.webm?t=1762306674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808350/extras/c7a5c570a9fd9f71ed158f4d81a2f2fa.mp4?t=1762306674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 70 areas to explore! Adventure through a world full of secret rooms and branching paths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn dozens of skills featuring multiple mastery tiers. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A character leveling system that rewards both exploration and prowess in combat. Earn experience points and spend them to read from over 100 skill books.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find new equipment, weapons, trinkets, and other goodies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet and converse with a wide cast of characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect achievements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idosra is highly moddable. You can edit the levels, maps, and dialog scripts using external tools. The modding system makes it easy to play a modified game and also preserve the original game data.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Explore the distant future in Idosra, an action-adventure RPG set in a world on the verge of rediscovering electricity. Follow Marika's quest to uncover the motives of the Vallas Empire. Learn dozens of new skills, meet a wide cast of characters, and discover the secrets of the lost city Idosra.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808350/header.jpg?t=1762306674", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808350/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762306674", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808350/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=17